00:16:25,680 --> 00:16:28,540
my love I'm sorry

251
00:16:31,340 --> 00:16:32,380
I've lost

252
00:16:37,700 --> 00:16:39,120
Spirit of the puzzle,

253
00:16:39,340 --> 00:16:42,177
I don't know how to thank
you It was your courage,

254
00:16:42,260 --> 00:16:47,201
and the love your friends had for you that
prevailed this day And your determination

255
00:16:48,940 --> 00:16:50,940
We all did it, together

256
00:16:51,760 --> 00:16:56,340
That's right, as friends And in the
end, that's what it came down to

257
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:57,950
Hmm.

258
00:16:58,033 --> 00:16:59,958
Friends being there for one another.

259
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:04,260
Hey, it's clearing up.

260
00:17:05,340 --> 00:17:09,300
Yeah, and I think I can
see something. Me too.

261
00:17:09,600 --> 00:17:11,197
You think it's...

262
00:17:11,280 --> 00:17:12,760
It is, huh?

263
00:17:13,100 --> 00:17:14,100
It's him!

264
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:17,130
Yugi!

265
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:21,837
You guys, thanks!

266
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:23,680
Oh man, Yugi, you did it.

267
00:17:23,820 --> 00:17:24,650
You really did it.

268
00:17:24,733 --> 00:17:26,197
You really...

269
00:17:26,280 --> 00:17:27,280
finally did it!

270
00:17:27,820 --> 00:17:30,177
What Joey is trying to
say is that it's really

271
00:17:30,260 --> 00:17:32,657
great you and your grandpa
are going to be reunited.

272
00:17:32,740 --> 00:17:33,622
Yeah, for sure.

273
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:34,677
But also you...

274
