Also, we wanted to say how impressed we
are with you for being so brave and all.

275
00:17:39,300 --> 00:17:40,937
Yeah, impressed. And we're...

276
00:17:41,020 --> 00:17:43,160
And we're proud of you, too.

277
00:17:45,180 --> 00:17:48,062
You guys are stealing
everything I was gonna say!

278
00:17:48,360 --> 00:17:49,500
So then talk!

279
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:52,520
Ah, forget it.

280
00:17:52,900 --> 00:17:55,240
Who cares? He won!

281
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:58,160
