everyone's souls, just like he promised.

287
00:18:09,080 --> 00:18:10,198
Yeah, Tay is right.

288
00:18:10,320 --> 00:18:12,202
So then let's go grab the creep.

289
00:18:17,300 --> 00:18:18,360
