291
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:23,297
Slippery double-crossing snake.

292
00:18:23,380 --> 00:18:24,460
Let's go find him.

293
00:18:24,860 --> 00:18:28,213
But we can't just leave Mokuba
and Bakura here all alone.

294
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:29,380
Hey, up here!

295
00:18:31,100 --> 00:18:31,930
Hello!

296
00:18:32,820 --> 00:18:34,220
