297
00:18:35,040 --> 00:18:35,870
Hey there.

298
00:18:35,980 --> 00:18:37,333
Feeling back to normal?

299
00:18:37,860 --> 00:18:39,200
What? Back to normal?

300
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:41,340
Have I not been normal, Tristan?

301
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:44,012
He must not be able to remember anything.

302
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:45,270
Yeah,

303
00:18:45,353 --> 00:18:46,557
that weird ring you wear around your neck

304
