a real freak again.

305
00:18:50,420 --> 00:18:51,597
Freak? Oh my.

306
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:53,160
His Millennium Ring?

307
00:18:53,500 --> 00:18:55,320
Where is it now? Gone.

308
00:18:55,580 --> 00:18:58,168
