314
00:19:12,660 --> 00:19:13,490
Good.

315
00:19:13,573 --> 00:19:15,771
Then let's go and find that creep Pegasus.

316
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:17,270
Mm-hmm.

317
00:19:17,353 --> 00:19:21,318
After all, he made a promise to
Frito's souls, and he's gonna keep it.

318
