If Pegasus restores Mokuba's soul,
his body will be useless to me.

319
00:19:26,600 --> 00:19:31,157
But it matters not, because now that
Pegasus is weakened by his duel with Yugi,

320
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:34,297
